  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2afbeabadf7e4c81d517f794066466f90d1f2f1a.png\" alt=\"IrisSearch_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Iris &amp; Oculus 搜索</h1>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=black&labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Source\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Source-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=black&labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><img alt=\"Iris Search\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Iris | Oculus | and derivatives-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=black&label=WORKS ON:&labelColor=050d18&color=e5f7ff\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Support\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Spaceagle17-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=black&label=Support&labelColor=e5f7ff\"></a></div>\n<h2>一款便利性模组，直接在 Iris 或 Oculus 着色器设置界面中添加了一个实用的搜索栏，让你能瞬间定位到特定的着色器选项。</h2>\n<h2>🔍 为什么使用此模组？</h2>\n<p>是否厌倦了在无尽的页面和子菜单中层层点击，只为寻找“植被摇曳”或“泛光”等特定开关？</p>\n<p><strong>Iris & Oculus Search</strong> 将搜索栏直接嵌入着色器选项图形界面。输入你想要的关键词，菜单便会动态筛选出匹配的设置。它完全支持 Fabric 或 NeoForge 上的 <strong>Iris</strong>，以及 Forge 上的 <strong>Oculus</strong>！</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无缝搜索着色器设置</strong>或<strong>着色器包</strong></li>\n<li><strong>界面内搜索栏：</strong>在着色器包选项菜单和着色器选择屏幕内部直接添加无缝集成的文本输入框</li>\n<li><strong>多语言支持：</strong>支持使用你选择的语言进行搜索（需着色器本身支持）。本模组本身也支持翻译。欢迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fprofile%252fspaceagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 参与贡献。</li>\n<li><strong>开箱即用：</strong>无需任何配置，安装后即可直接使用，零配置文件修改。</li>\n<li><strong>加载器兼容性：</strong>支持 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上的 <strong>Iris</strong>，以及 Forge 上的 <strong>Oculus</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>版本支持：</strong>兼容 <strong>1.20.1+</strong> 至最新 Minecraft 版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong>此模组必须安装 <strong>Iris</strong> 或 <strong>Oculus</strong> 作为硬性依赖。缺少其中之一将无法正常运行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252frLCE-IV_fng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa075629-4a4e-48b6-8c27-effac8420b9f\" alt=\"YouTube 视频\"></a></p>\n<h2>相关链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon 或 Ko-fi</a> 上支持 SpacEagle17</strong></li>\n<li><strong>联系方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Discord 服务器：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/discord</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Iris &amp; Oculus Search</strong> 的源代码托管于 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>赞助商：Ember Host</h2>\n<p>正在寻找性价比高且稳定的 Minecraft 服务器托管服务？Ember Host 提供极具竞争力的价格和顶级技术支持！</p>\n<p>点击横幅或在结账时使用优惠码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，首单可享 <strong>10%</strong> 折扣。此外，你的消费金额中有 <strong>70%</strong> 将直接用于支持 Iris &amp; Oculus Search！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f0932rwjieopf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
